OL,3,GNEWSAWoman in her 80s dies after being
OL,4,Ahit by a van
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 80s has died after she
OL,7,Fwas hit by a van in Lincolnshire,
OL,8,Fpolice have confirmed.
OL,10,FThe force said it was called to Bridge
OL,11,FRoad in Sutton Bridge just before 13:45
OL,12,FBST on Tuesday, to reports of a crash
OL,13,Fbetween a white Ford Transit van and a
OL,14,Fpedestrian.
OL,16,FLincolnshire Police said she was taken
OL,17,Fto hospital but died overnight.
OL,19,FAnyone who witnessed the incident, or
OL,20,Fhas dashcam, doorbell or CCTV footage
OL,21,Ffrom around the time, is asked to
OL,22,Fcontact police.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
